The packaged synthetic astronomy examples contain authored factual paraphrases
and unreviewed Odia translations, with attribution to NASA source URLs in their
corpus records and provenance manifest. They are draft examples, not a validated
Odia benchmark. Original source snapshots remain in the repository and are not
included in wheels. Model weights are not included; their publishers' licenses
and access conditions apply separately. Rust dependency licenses are available
in their respective upstream packages.
